<title>CROATIA: Croatian PPI flat in August, slows to 1.3 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatian PPI flat in August, slows to 1.3 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA PRODUCER PRICES     AUGUST   JAN-AUG   JULY   AUG '95</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	   0.0	 --	 0.0    +0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year		    +1.3	+1.5     +1.7    +0.8</p>
<p>NOTES -- Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly producer price inflation was running at 29.1 percent. -- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
